  "about": "Town building looks. styles: folder name -> sheets (3 x 5, one building per cell, reading order by the feet) and skip (1-based cells that are not buildings: walls, plazas). `npm run buildings:slice -- <style>...` makes <style>/<style>_atlas.png and <style>/<style>.json with frames <style>_NN. biomes: field biome -> styles its towns draw from (one building per footprint, picked by position); 'default' for the rest. Looks only: any building stands for any service. doors: frame number -> [face, t]: the art's door is on the L (down-left) or R (down-right) face, t from the face's left end (0) to its right end (1); frames left out have no door and suit door-less houses. A mirror moves an L door at t to R at 1 - t.",
